  "description": "MIHHUJ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 Ce4 F36 N8 O20,2(C3 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.997-4.110 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.72-112.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Ce4.",
